  "question": "We denote the largest integer less than or equal to \\(z\\) by \\([z]\\). Consider the identity \\((1+x)(10+x)(10^2+x)\\cdots(10^{10}+x)=10^a+10^b x+a_2x^2+\\cdots+a_{11}x^{11}.\\) Then",
